Wiki Page tables: a resize handle on the right edge of a table sets a width of its own in px ("Resize table"); while dragging, the width snaps to Text width, Medium, Wide and Full width, and a drag that ends on one of them stores that step. The width menu shows the custom width and resets it to a step; stored column widths scale with the table; the view and the history diff show the width ("Width: Medium → 1180px"). https://gitlab.kitconcept.io/kitconcept/distribution-kitconcept-intranet/-/work_items/824 @reekitconcept
